// The deck: 20 planks of 1.1 x 0.4 m along a parabola 2.2 m deep with 1-cell gaps,
// so it hangs slack. Two iron bolts per plank put the wood under half its mass, so
// a plank never shatters on a jolt: only the hinges decide where the bridge fails.
// Pins are unbreakable; so is every hinge but the centre one.
