view 960 540
scale 2
sky cave
// High-ish ambient with moderate exposure keeps the lava orange instead of blown out.
ambient 0.08 0.1 0.15
exposure 1.45
// Open wide on the chasm, ease in on the deck for the crate and glass, pull back
// for the break, then hold on the dangling halves.
at 0: 360 212 zoom=1.5
at 480: 360 200 zoom=1.9
at 900: 360 214 zoom=1.6
at 2100: 360 214 zoom=1.6
